PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,FThe number of sexual orientation hate
OL,7,Fcrime charges in Dumfries reported to
OL,8,Fthe Crown Office has more than doubled
OL,9,Fin the last nine years.
OL,11,FReports of charges have increased from
OL,12,F17 to 44, according to figures from
OL,13,Fthe Crown Office and Procurator Fiscal
OL,14,FService.
OL,16,F23-year-old Will Wallace lives in
OL,17,FDumfries and runs a small business
OL,18,Falongside his partner, Ian.
OL,20,FHe first realised he was gay nearly
OL,21,Ften years ago.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,FSpeaking about his early experience,
OL,7,Fhe said: "There was a lot of slurs
OL,8,Fslung about, there was pushing,
OL,9,Fshoving, things thrown, being singled
OL,10,Fout, being called named in the PE
OL,11,Fchanging rooms, and stuff like that,
OL,12,Fdidn't, didn't enjoy being there."
OL,14,FAfter a tough experience growing up,
OL,15,Fhe left the school corridors and hoped
OL,16,Fhe'd left behind the hate .
OL,18,FBut even in early adulthood, he says
OL,19,Fhe's been the victim of hate crimes
OL,20,Fbecause of his sexuality.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,FWill added: "I'd finished work one
OL,7,Fnight and I was waiting for a bus and
OL,8,Fit was quite a... I wouldn't say it
OL,9,Fwas a serious event that happened, it
OL,10,Fwas name calling... and I was just
OL,11,Flike, 'no I'm not going to sit here
OL,12,Fand take that', and I reported it.
OL,14,F"Unfortunately they didn't find out
OL,15,Fwho it was, but I reported it and that
OL,16,Fis half the battle.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
