OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,F"It can have a lifelong effect on
OL,7,Fpeople and you definitely need to
OL,8,Freport it, and it could be that people
OL,9,Fare more confident to report it and
OL,10,Fthat's why figures have changed, but
OL,11,Fat the same time, in this day and age
OL,12,Fit is disappointing that people are
OL,13,Fstill acting like that and are OK to
OL,14,Fsay slurs and things like that."
OL,16,FWhat is a hate crime?
OL,18,FChief Superintendent Claire Dobson
OL,19,Fsaid: "Any incident of hate is
OL,20,Fcompletely unacceptable in a modern
OL,21,Fand tolerant society.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,F"I want to make it clear that any
OL,7,Fincident reported to us will be
OL,8,Fsubject of a robust investigation to
OL,9,Fapprehend those responsible.
OL,11,F"We know it can be difficult for
OL,12,Fpeople to report a hate crime, and in
OL,13,Fsome cases to even recognise or
OL,14,Facknowledge they have been a victim.
OL,15,FBut we want everyone targeted by hate
OL,16,Fcrime, or those who witness it, to
OL,17,Fhave confidence to come forward.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,F"They can be assured they will be
OL,7,Ftreated with dignity and respect, and
OL,8,Fthat the circumstances they report
OL,9,Fwill be fully investigated."
OL,11,FLord Advocate Ruth Charteris KC spoke
OL,12,Fabout the annual report on hate crime
OL,13,Fin Scotland, saying: "Everyone who
OL,14,Flives in Scotland is entitled to feel
OL,15,Fsafe and every hate crime represents a
OL,16,Fdecision to target a person because of
OL,17,Fwho they are.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,F"I want to reach out to communities
OL,7,Facross Scotland and say that
OL,8,Fprosecutors are here to ensure that
OL,9,Fevery report of a crime motivated by
OL,10,Fhate will be carefully considered and
OL,11,Fbrought before the court where
OL,12,Fappropriate.
OL,14,F"That commitment is reflected in our
OL,15,Fresponse to reports of hate crime.
OL,16,FLast year, 94% of charges resulted in
OL,17,Fprosecutorial action, while only 2% of
OL,18,Fall hate crime charges reported
OL,19,Fresulted in no prosecutorial action.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
