PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1787060963
OL,3,C"It can have a lifelong effect": LGBTQ
OL,4,C+ hate crimes
OL,6,F"We each have a role to play in
OL,7,Fchallenging the actions of those who
OL,8,Fare motivated by prejudice and hate."
OL,10,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,11,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,12,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,13,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,14,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,15,Fbelow...
